<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Lot/Seri Soyağacı İzlenebilirlik — Enterprise ERP</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    .tree-container {
      background: var(--bg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 28px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    .tree-step {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 20px;
      position: relative;
      padding-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .tree-step::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      left: 21px;
      top: 40px;
      bottom: 0;
      width: 2px;
      background: var(--border);
    }
    .tree-step:last-child::before {
      display: none;
    }
    .tree-icon {
      width: 44px; height: 44px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #090e1a;
      border: 2px solid #6366f1;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      z-index: 2;
    }
    .tree-content {
      flex: 1;
      background: #090e1a;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 16px 20px;
    }
    .tree-title { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .tree-meta { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .tree-tag { background: rgba(99,102,241,0.15); color: #818cf8; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 6px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600; }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="module-body">
  <aside class="module-sidebar">
    <div class="module-sidebar-brand">
      <a href="/" class="msb-logo">
        <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none"><rect width="32" height="32" rx="8" fill="url(#bGrad)"/><path d="M8 12h16M8 16h12M8 20h8" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><defs><linearGradient id="bGrad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="32" y2="32"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#6366f1"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#8b5cf6"/></linearGradient></defs></svg>
        <span>Enterprise ERP</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="module-sidebar-section">
      <div class="mss-label">🛡️ KALİTE KONTROL & GÜVENCE</div>

      <div class="mss-group-title">📊 KONTROL PANELİ</div>
      <div class="mss-sub">
        <a href="/quality/analytics" class="mss-sub-link">📊 Kalite Analitiği & Özet</a>
      </div>

      <div class="mss-group-title">🔍 MUAYENE & KONTROL</div>
      <div class="mss-sub">
        <a href="/quality/inspections" class="mss-sub-link">📥 Giriş / Proses / Final Muayeneleri</a>
        <a href="/quality/inspections/add" class="mss-sub-link">➕ Yeni Muayene Kaydı</a>
      </div>

      <div class="mss-group-title">⚠️ UYGUNSUZLUK & AKSİYON</div>
      <div class="mss-sub">
        <a href="/quality/ncr" class="mss-sub-link">⚠️ Uygunsuzluk Yönetimi (NCR)</a>
        <a href="/quality/ncr/add" class="mss-sub-link">➕ Yeni NCR Kaydı</a>
        <a href="/quality/capa" class="mss-sub-link">🛠️ Düzeltici & Önleyici Faaliyet (CAPA)</a>
      </div>

      <div class="mss-group-title">🌳 İZLENEBİLİRLİK & KALİBRASYON</div>
      <div class="mss-sub">
        <a href="/quality/traceability" class="mss-sub-link active">🌳 Lot/Seri Soyağacı İzlenebilirlik</a>
        <a href="/quality/equipment" class="mss-sub-link">📏 Ölçüm Cihazı Kalibrasyon Takibi</a>
        <a href="/quality/documents" class="mss-sub-link">📜 ISO Kalite Belgeleri</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="module-sidebar-user">
      <div class="msu-avatar"><%= user.username.charAt(0).toUpperCase() %></div>
      <div class="msu-meta">
        <strong><%= user.firstName ? user.firstName + ' ' + user.lastName : user.username %></strong>
        <span><%= user.role %></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <div class="module-main">
    <header class="module-topbar">
      <div class="mt-left">
        <a href="/" class="mt-link">Ana Sayfa</a>
        <a href="/admin" class="mt-link">Sistem Yönetimi</a>
        <a href="/stock" class="mt-link">Stok & Depo</a>
        <a href="/sales" class="mt-link">Satış Yönetimi</a>
        <a href="/purchase" class="mt-link">Satın Alma</a>
        <a href="/production" class="mt-link">Üretim Planlama</a>
        <a href="/quality" class="mt-link active">Kalite Kontrol</a>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-right">
        <span class="mt-time" id="liveTime"></span>
        <a href="/logout" class="mt-logout" title="Çıkış">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4"/><polyline points="16 17 21 12 16 7"/><line x1="21" y1="12" x2="9" y2="12"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="module-content">
      <div class="module-subnav">
        <a href="/quality/analytics" class="msn-link">📊 Özet Panel</a>
        <a href="/quality/inspections" class="msn-link">🔍 Muayene Kayıtları</a>
        <a href="/quality/ncr" class="msn-link">⚠️ Uygunsuzluk (NCR)</a>
        <a href="/quality/capa" class="msn-link">🛠️ Aksiyon (CAPA)</a>
        <a href="/quality/traceability" class="msn-link active">🌳 Lot İzlenebilirlik</a>
        <a href="/quality/equipment" class="msn-link">📏 Kalibrasyon Takibi</a>
        <a href="/quality/documents" class="msn-link">📜 ISO Belgeleri</a>
      </div>

      <div class="page-header">
        <div>
          <h1>Geriye Dönük Lot/Seri Soyağacı (Genealogical Traceability Tree)</h1>
          <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.95rem; margin-top: 4px;">Hatalı bir partinin tedarikçi girişinden imalat tezgahına ve nihai müşteri sevkiyatına kadar uçtan uca izlenebilirliği.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Lot Search Bar -->
      <div style="background: var(--bg-surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 16px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 24px; display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center;">
        <span style="font-size: 1.2rem;">🔍</span>
        <form action="/quality/traceability" method="GET" style="display: flex; gap: 12px; flex: 1;">
          <input type="text" name="lotNumber" value="<%= searchLot %>" placeholder="Sorgulanacak Lot / Seri No girin (Örn: LOT-2026-A101)..." style="flex: 1; background: #090e1a; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 14px; color: var(--text-primary); outline: none;">
          <button type="submit" class="btn-indigo-gradient" style="padding: 10px 20px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 10px; color: #fff; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #4f46e5); border: none; cursor: pointer;">
            🌳 Soyağacını Getir
          </button>
        </form>
      </div>

      <!-- Traceability Tree -->
      <div class="tree-container">
        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-primary);">
          Sorgulanan Lot: <span class="tree-tag" style="font-size: 1.05rem;"><%= searchLot %></span>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 1: Supplier & Goods Receipt -->
        <div class="tree-step">
          <div class="tree-icon" style="border-color: #38bdf8; color: #38bdf8;">📥</div>
          <div class="tree-content">
            <div class="tree-title">1. Tedarikçi Mal Kabulü & İrsaliye</div>
            <div class="tree-meta">Tedarikçi: <strong>Borusan Çelik A.Ş.</strong> • İrsaliye No: <span class="tree-tag">IRS-2026-9901</span> • Depo: <strong>Depo-A (Hammadde Ambarı)</strong></div>
            <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #34d399; font-weight: 600;">✓ Mal kabul fiziksel miktar sayımı tamamlandı ve karantinaya alındı.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2: Incoming Quality Control (IQC) -->
        <div class="tree-step">
          <div class="tree-icon" style="border-color: #34d399; color: #34d399;">🔍</div>
          <div class="tree-content">
            <div class="tree-title">2. Giriş Kalite Kontrol Muayenesi (IQC)</div>
            <div class="tree-meta">Muayene Kodu: <span class="tree-tag">IQC-2026-0001</span> • Kalite Uzmanı: <strong>Selin Arslan</strong></div>
            <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">
              100 Adet numune test edildi. 98 Adet Kabul / 2 Adet Minör Yüzey Çiziği. <span style="background: rgba(16,185,129,0.15); color: #34d399; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 700;">✓ KULLANIMA UYGUN KABUL</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3: Production Work Order (MES) -->
        <div class="tree-step">
          <div class="tree-icon" style="border-color: #a78bfa; color: #a78bfa;">🏭</div>
          <div class="tree-content">
            <div class="tree-title">3. Fabrika İmalat & İş Emri (MES)</div>
            <div class="tree-meta">İş Emri: <span class="tree-tag">URETIM-2026-0001</span> • Operasyon: <strong>OP-10 Torna & CNC Kesim</strong> • Tezgah: <strong>Tezgah-01 (HAAS CNC)</strong></div>
            <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">
              Hammadde iş emrine rezerve edildi ve üretim hattına sevk edildi.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 4: Final Quality Control (FQC) -->
        <div class="tree-step">
          <div class="tree-icon" style="border-color: #fbbf24; color: #fbbf24;">🏁</div>
          <div class="tree-content">
            <div class="tree-title">4. Final Kalite Kontrolü & Ambalaj (FQC)</div>
            <div class="tree-meta">Muayene Kodu: <span class="tree-tag">FQC-2026-0001</span> • Kontrolör: <strong>Selin Arslan</strong></div>
            <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #34d399; font-weight: 600;">
              ✓ 200 Adet bitmiş ürün nihai kalite kriterlerine göre doğrulandı. Müşteri sevkiyatı onaylandı.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 5: Customer Dispatch -->
        <div class="tree-step">
          <div class="tree-icon" style="border-color: #38bdf8; color: #38bdf8;">🚗</div>
          <div class="tree-content">
            <div class="tree-title">5. Müşteri Sevkiyatı & Fatura</div>
            <div class="tree-meta">Müşteri: <strong>Otobüs & Otomotiv Sanayi A.Ş.</strong> • Satış Siparişi: <span class="tree-tag">SATIS-2026-0001</span></div>
            <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 600;">
              📦 Ürünler ilgili lot numarası ile müşteriye teslim edildi.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>

  <script>
    function updateClock() { const now = new Date(); const el = document.getElementById('liveTime'); if (el) el.textContent = now.toLocaleDateString('tr-TR', { day: 'numeric', month: 'long' }) + ' • ' + now.toLocaleTimeString('tr-TR', { hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit' }); }
    updateClock(); setInterval(updateClock, 1000);
  </script>
</body>
</html>
